    "Game Designer, Character Designer, Animation Designer": "游戏设计、角色设计、动画设计",
    "Embark on an immersive adventure with Dreamchaser, a captivating puzzle platformer that takes players on a profound journey through the realms of dreams and memories. This game offers a unique and engaging experience that combines compelling gameplay mechanics, a rich narrative, and visually stunning art styles.": "Dream Chaser 是一款以梦境与记忆为主题的解谜平台游戏。玩家将踏上一段沉浸式旅程，体验丰富的玩法、叙事与视觉风格。",
    "Navigate dreamscapes, collect memories, and reclaim what's lost. Run, jump, change forms, and use a dreamcatcher. Face enemies and spikes, strategically collect hearts, or choose a more challenging path by avoiding them.": "穿越梦境，收集记忆，找回失去的事物。奔跑、跳跃、变换形态，使用捕梦网；躲避敌人与尖刺，策略性地收集爱心，或选择不收集来挑战更高难度。",
    "Diverse worlds, each with a distinct color palette. Level 1 in stark white portrays confusion, Level 2 in vibrant greens and yellows transforms into a jungle, and Level 3's desert signals the narrative climax.": "不同世界拥有各自的色彩：第一关以冷白表现迷茫，第二关以鲜明的绿与黄呈现丛林，第三关的沙漠将故事推向高潮。",
    "Your journey begins in the Dream Therapist's office, where I personally guided the framework for a deeply immersive narrative. Dark, dream-like music sets the tone, and your visual contributions, along with the experimental effects, bring characters and elements to life, adding a layer of personal connection to the dreamworld.": "旅程从梦境治疗师的办公室开始。我负责构建沉浸式叙事框架，以幽暗、梦幻的音乐奠定基调，结合视觉设计和实验性效果，让角色与梦境更加鲜活，也建立更私人的情感联系。",
    "I handled character design, titles, and props. This personal touch enhances the overall aesthetic, creating a visually compelling and unique identity for Dreamchaser.": "我负责角色、标题与道具设计，为 Dream Chaser 建立了鲜明且统一的视觉语言。",
    "In addition to character design, I personally curated experimental visual effects, enriching the game with a visually dynamic and experimental edge. Your journey through Dreamchaser will be a feast for the senses, with every detail thoughtfully considered.": "除了角色设计，我也设计了实验性视觉效果，为梦境增添动态变化，细致打磨每一个感官体验。",
    "Challenge yourself while enjoying a flexible experience. Restart levels or the entire game without frustration. Explore, discover, and chase your dreams in a game tailored for you.": "在灵活的体验中挑战自己：可以随时重开关卡或整个游戏。探索、发现，并追逐属于你的梦。",
    "Game Designer, Visual Designer": "游戏设计、视觉设计",
    "\"Where Is My Body\" is more than just a game; it's an immersive experience that challenges players to navigate an endless runner world with a unique twist. As the mind behind the character art framework and the architect of the story, I ensured that every element resonates with a personal touch.": "Where Is My Body 以独特的设定重新诠释无尽跑酷。我负责角色美术框架与故事设计，让每个细节都带有个人创作的印记。",
    "Storyboards / Where Is My Body ·": "分镜 / Where Is My Body ·",
    "Open original PDF ↗": "打开原始 PDF ↗",
    "The heartbeat of the game lies in its characters. I meticulously designed the general character art framework, infusing personality and charm into each element. From the protagonist to the supporting cast, every character is a reflection of my creative vision.": "角色是游戏的核心。我细致设计了整体角色美术框架，为主角与配角赋予个性和魅力，让每一个角色都承载我的创作构想。",
    "A game without a story is like a body without a soul. In \"Where Is My Body,\" I constructed a narrative that adds depth and purpose to the endless runner experience. The story unfolds seamlessly, creating an emotional connection that keeps players engaged as they run through the ever-changing landscape.": "没有故事的游戏，如同没有灵魂的身体。在 Where Is My Body 中，我为跑酷体验加入叙事深度与目标，让故事随场景自然展开，持续建立玩家与角色之间的情感联系。",
    "The technical backbone of \"Where Is My Body\" is powered by Phaser, a versatile and powerful game development framework. Leveraging my expertise, I harnessed Phaser's capabilities to create a seamless and enjoyable gaming experience.": "Where Is My Body 使用 Phaser 开发。我运用这一灵活的游戏开发框架，实现流畅、有趣的游戏体验。",
    "Solo Project": "个人项目",
    "In the dynamic world of game development, my journey took an exciting turn during a rapid prototype course, where the idea of creating a beatbox system triggered by mouse clicks emerged. This concept was born out of an inspiring brainstorming session with my teammates, drawing parallels between a captivating game and a music visualizer I had coded in the Summer of 2020. The vision further evolved with inspiration from a colleague's artistic project involving magnetic fields and mouse interaction. This fusion led to the conception of a unified, one-button game that incorporated these diverse elements, promising an innovative and immersive player experience.": "在快速原型课程中，我与队友讨论出一个由鼠标点击触发的节奏系统。灵感来自游戏、我在 2020 年夏天编写的音乐可视化作品，以及同伴关于磁场与鼠标交互的艺术实验。这些想法共同形成了一个融合多种体验的单键游戏。",
    "Playthrough Presentation": "实机演示",
    "Play": "播放",
    "The central query driving my prototype was straightforward yet ambitious: \"How can a one-button game harmoniously integrate elements from a game, a music visualizer, and a colleague's magnetic-field project?\" The answer lay in the prototype's revelation. Integration transformed functionality and user experience. Elements from the game introduced engaging interaction, letting players intentionally contribute to the beat. The music visualizer elements brought dynamic and responsive visual feedback, syncing with the rhythm. Inspired by my colleague's magnetic fields, the game added a captivating visual intensity, creating an immersive and visually stimulating experience. The outcome was not just a game; it was a harmonious blend where a single click orchestrated a symphony.": "原型的核心问题是：如何用一个按键融合游戏、音乐可视化与磁场交互？游戏机制让玩家主动参与节奏；可视化提供同步的动态反馈；磁场灵感则带来更强烈的视觉表现。一次点击，将多种体验连在一起。",
    "Yet, the journey to harmonize these inspirations into a one-button game wasn't without challenges. Positioning arrow characters on the screen became a nuanced struggle, demanding refinement for a seamless player experience. An unexpected realization dawned during implementation—I yearned to enhance visualization further with particles. However, limitations within the current library prompted me to explore alternative solutions and libraries to align the game closer with my vision.": "融合这些想法也带来了挑战。方向箭头的位置需要反复调整，才能形成自然的操作体验。我也希望加入粒子效果，但现有库的限制促使我探索其他工具与实现方式。",
    "\"One Button Harmony\" evolved through revisions, transforming into a green light-red light dynamic. A click on yellow and green lights brought points, while the red light deducted them. To elevate this one-button symphony, I am committed to refining the arrow character positioning, ensuring an intuitive and fluid user interaction. My dedication to exploring advanced particle effects aims to augment the visual experience, immersing players deeper into the harmonious world created by a simple, yet powerful, click.": "经过多轮修改，One Button Harmony 演变为红绿灯机制：在黄灯、绿灯时点击得分，红灯时点击扣分。后续方向包括优化箭头位置与交互，并探索粒子效果，让单键体验更直观、更有表现力。",
    "Download for Mac": "下载 Mac 版",
    "Download for Window": "下载 Windows 版",
    "Game Designer, Programmer": "游戏设计、程序开发",
    "\"Dorm Escape\" immerses players in a chilling atmosphere, trapped in a dark dorm where supernatural phenomena unfold. Armed with only a flickering flashlight, players navigate through the eerie rooms, encountering mysterious occurrences. The game offers a thrilling experience as players explore and decipher clues to escape the dorm's enigmatic confines.": "Escape the Dorm 将玩家困在发生超自然现象的黑暗宿舍中。你只有一束闪烁的手电光，需要穿过诡异房间，探索、解读线索并寻找出口。",
    "The creation of the dorm assets was a collaborative effort with a talented team. Together, we brought the dormitory to life, incorporating various elements to enhance its eerie ambiance. The team's dedication and creativity played a crucial role in shaping the environment, making it an integral part of the overall gaming experience.": "宿舍场景资源由团队共同制作。我们加入多种营造恐怖氛围的细节，让环境成为游戏体验的重要组成部分。",
    "I took the lead in coding light rendering, a critical mechanic guiding players through the darkened dorm. My expertise in this area brought the crucial flashlight mechanic to life, shaping the gameplay experience. My skills in resource navigation were key in sourcing and implementing a captivating night skybox. This addition enhanced the overall atmosphere, creating a haunting escape experience that engages players on a deeper level.": "我主要负责光照渲染程序，实现引导玩家探索黑暗宿舍的手电机制，也寻找并整合夜空天空盒，让场景更有氛围与沉浸感。",
    "The game incorporates post-processing effects like bloom, color adjustments, vignette, and channel mixer to enhance visual appeal and intensify the mysterious ambiance.": "游戏使用辉光、色彩调整、暗角与通道混合等后期处理，增强视觉表现与神秘氛围。",
    "In \"Escape the Dorm,\" the fusion of flashlight coding, creative brainstorming, and resource navigation results in a captivating and spine-tingling gaming experience. Can you decipher the clues and escape the dorm's clutches, or will the supernatural phenomena keep you trapped in the dark? The answers await in the chilling corridors of the dormitory.": "Escape the Dorm 将手电机制、创意构思和场景资源结合，带来紧张的探索体验。你能解开谜题逃出宿舍，还是会被困在黑暗中？答案藏在走廊深处。",
    "Game Designer, Storytelling": "游戏设计、叙事设计",
    "\"A Wonderful Week\" is a horror dating simulator, immersing players in the role of a psychologist treating Jennifer, who struggles with Dissociative Identity Disorder (DID). The game delves into a complex narrative where the player must navigate the delicate balance of earning trust and favorability from Jennifer's dual personalities—a benevolent side and a malevolent devil side. As the psychologist, you must unravel hidden truths, all while avoiding the peril of the devil side's murderous intentions. The game culminates in various endings based on the player's choices and the level of trust cultivated with Jennifer.": "A Wonderful Week 是一款恐怖恋爱模拟游戏。玩家扮演治疗 Jennifer 的心理医生，在这部虚构故事中，她具有善良与危险的双重人格。你需要通过选择赢得信任、寻找隐藏的真相，并躲避危险；不同选择和信任程度会导向不同结局。",
    "The game adopts a Branch and Bottleneck design pattern, allowing events to branch based on player choices, variables, and states. This dynamic structure, illustrated through a Twine graph, ensures a varied narrative experience with multiple possible endings.": "游戏采用分支与汇合的叙事结构，根据玩家选择、变量和状态展开事件。Twine 流程图呈现了这种结构，并支持多种结局。",
    "To enhance the narrative, we employed CSS formatting in the HTML version, assigning colors to characters for clarity. Easter eggs and hidden messages, represented by different colors, add intrigue. In Cthulhu-inspired elements, we integrated R'lyeh language, symbols in the commercial list, and interactive fourth-wall-breaking moments with Hastur, creating a unique and immersive experience.": "HTML 版本通过 CSS 为不同角色设置颜色，帮助阅读；不同颜色的彩蛋与隐藏信息也增加了探索趣味。受克苏鲁元素启发，我们加入拉莱耶语、列表符号，以及与哈斯塔互动时打破第四面墙的片段。",
    "In \"Psychological Odyssey: Unraveling Minds,\" the fusion of narrative intricacies, dynamic choices, and immersive elements promises players an enthralling journey through the realms of psychology, suspense, and the unknown. Will you decipher the mysteries or succumb to the madness that lurks within? The answers lie in the choices you make on this psychological odyssey.": "复杂叙事、动态选择与沉浸式元素共同构成一段关于心理、悬疑与未知的旅程。玩家能否解开谜团，取决于旅途中作出的选择。",
    "Embark on a heart-pounding journey with \"SCP Escape,\" a decrypt and escape game set within the SCP Foundation prison. As a vulnerable class-D member, you find yourself trapped amidst anti-human SCP characters during a chaotic breakout. Navigate the dangerous asylum, interacting with SCP characters, making crucial decisions, and solving puzzles to secure your safe escape.": "SCP Escape 是一款发生在 SCP 基金会监狱中的解谜逃脱游戏。玩家扮演脆弱的 D 级人员，在混乱的收容失效中穿越危险区域，与 SCP 实体互动、作出抉择并解决谜题，寻找逃生之路。",
    "During the planning session, I, along with my friend Zixin, a passionate SCP lover, meticulously mapped out the game. We strategically placed locations and interconnections within the SCP Foundation prison, guiding the distinct branch rejoin hyperstructure. This collaboration allowed players to explore various approaches, fostering decision-making integral to the escape narrative.": "我与热爱 SCP 的朋友 Zixin 一起规划游戏地图，设计监狱内各地点与路径的连接，建立分支汇合结构，让玩家能以不同方式探索与决策。",
    "It appears you don't have a PDF plugin for this browser. You can": "你的浏览器可能无法显示 PDF。你可以",
    "click here to download the PDF file.": "点击这里下载 PDF 文件。",
    "The game utilizes links for navigation and conversation choices with guiding SCP characters. Encounter potentially harmful characters such as SCP 173, SCP 096, SCP 939, SCP 682, SCP 053, SCP 0294, SCP 035, SCP 073, SCP 953, SCP 847, SCP 860, and SCP 458. Choices dictate outcomes—earn time to dodge or face an immediate bad ending. This link structure adds dynamism, providing players agency in survival scenarios.": "游戏通过链接导航与对话选择推动互动，玩家会遇到 SCP 173、096、939、682、053、0294、035、073、953、847、860 与 458 等实体。选择决定能否及时避险或进入坏结局，让玩家在生存过程中拥有决策空间。",
    "The \"Distinct Branch Rejoin\" hyperstructure aligns with the game's link structure. Nodes, organized based on the SCP Foundation prison's geography, enable varied approaches, fostering exploration and decision-making integral to the escape narrative. In \"SCP Escape,\" players are thrust into the heart of SCP Foundation chaos, where every choice matters. Decrypt mysteries, navigate dangers, and emerge victorious in this intense escape narrative. The choice is yours in the dark corridors of the asylum.": "分支汇合结构与监狱地图相结合，鼓励多路径探索与决策。在 SCP 基金会的混乱中，每一步选择都很重要：解读谜题、避开危险，并尝试成功逃离。",
    "Read Article": "阅读文章",
    "Director, Editor": "导演、剪辑",
    "News Journal": "新闻报道",
    "Contributing to the collaborative endeavor of the news journal's project, \"Experiences With Distance Learning,\" our focus was to delve into the challenges and opportunities of distance learning within the Oakland Unified School District (OUSD).": "在 Experiences With Distance Learning 合作报道项目中，我们关注奥克兰联合学区（OUSD）远程学习面临的挑战与机会。",
    "Taking the lead in formulating the initial pitch, the project was conceptualized to amplify student voices, delve into teacher experiences, and gain insights from OUSD administration. The pitch highlighted the necessity of creating an informative blog shedding light on the effectiveness of distance learning in OUSD.": "我主导最初的选题提案，希望让学生的声音被听见，了解教师经历与学区管理层观点，通过博客讨论远程学习的成效。",
    "Contributions involved crafting central questions to guide interviews, ensuring a comprehensive exploration. Emphasis was placed on understanding the pros and cons of OUSD distance learning, gathering teacher perspectives, exploring desired changes from students, and investigating updates planned by OUSD for the future.": "我参与制定采访的核心问题，研究远程学习的利弊、教师观点、学生期待的改变，以及学区未来的调整计划。",
    "Active involvement included organizing interviews with teachers, students, and OUSD administration, along with compiling data on distance learning effectiveness. Researching developments for the upcoming school year was integral to the collaborative effort.": "我参与安排教师、学生和学区管理人员的采访，整理远程学习成效资料，并研究下一学年的变化。",
    "Taking charge of the editing process, efforts were directed toward ensuring clarity, coherence, and conciseness in the blog. The goal was to maintain a cohesive structure, allowing readers to navigate smoothly through diverse perspectives.": "我负责编辑，使文章清晰、连贯、简洁，并保持结构统一，帮助读者理解不同视角。",
    "As a collaborator, active participation in team discussions allowed for the contribution of insights and expertise to enhance the overall quality of the project. The role involved steering the project towards its objectives, ensuring that each team member's strengths were leveraged effectively. This project reflects a commitment to delivering impactful journalism and showcases the ability to navigate collaborative efforts, bringing diverse perspectives to the forefront in the news journal context.": "我积极参与团队讨论，分享想法并协助推进目标，让每位成员发挥所长。这个项目体现了我对有影响力的新闻报道的投入，以及整合不同观点、协作完成内容的能力。",
    "Project Manager, Script Writter": "项目管理、编剧",
    "\"Insomnium\" delves into the extraordinary life of a boy blessed with the ability to dream the future, a gift that turns into a curse known as \"insomnium.\" As the protagonist navigates this unique condition, the story unravels the mysterious black market of dream trading, where people exchange visions for the creation of blockbuster film productions. Amidst the cinematic allure, the narrative also delves into the protagonist's personal journey of discovering hidden truths about their own family.": "Insomnium 讲述一个能够梦见未来的男孩，他的天赋逐渐成为诅咒。故事揭开一个买卖梦境、用预见制作电影的神秘黑市，同时跟随主角探寻家族隐藏的真相。",
    "Inital Version of EP1": "第一集初稿",
    "Combine With Team Ideation Full Present Version": "融合团队构思的完整版本",
    "In the initial pitch, I conceptualized the core premise of \"Insomnium,\" crafting a narrative that blends the fantastical elements of precognitive dreaming with the darker underbelly of a dream trading black market. The aim was to create a series that seamlessly intertwines supernatural elements with a suspenseful exploration of personal secrets.": "我在最初提案中构思了 Insomnium 的核心设定，将预知梦与梦境交易黑市结合，创造一个交织超自然元素、悬疑与私人秘密的剧集。",
    "My involvement extended to script development, where I worked on shaping the storyline, character arcs, and dialogues. Additionally, I played a crucial role in the production planning phase, ensuring that the vision for \"Insomnium\" translated effectively from script to screen. This included coordinating with the creative team, managing logistics, and refining the execution strategy to capture the essence of the story.": "我参与故事线、人物弧光与对白的编写，也负责制作规划，协调创作团队、安排流程并优化执行，让剧本构想转化为影像。",
    "\"Insomnium\" stands out for its innovative exploration of dreams and their tangible impact on both personal lives and the broader entertainment industry. The black market concept adds a layer of intrigue, questioning the ethical boundaries of dream utilization for artistic creation. The series blends mystery, supernatural elements, and family drama, creating a multifaceted narrative that resonates with diverse audiences.": "Insomnium 探索梦境对个人生活与娱乐产业的影响。黑市设定也提出了将梦境用于艺术创作的伦理问题，结合悬疑、超自然与家庭戏剧形成多层次叙事。",
    "\"Insomnium\" is not just a web series; it's an exploration of dreams, family secrets, and the consequences of wielding a unique ability. My contributions to the conceptualization, script development, and production planning have been instrumental in shaping the narrative and ensuring a compelling visual representation of this intriguing story.": "Insomnium 不只是一部网络剧集，也探讨梦境、家族秘密与特殊能力的代价。我参与概念、剧本与制作规划，协助形成连贯且有表现力的故事。",
    "Game Poster": "游戏海报",
    "The overall design concept draws inspiration from the lighthearted nature of Solitaire, aiming to convey a sense of sweetness and playful entertainment. The combination of fonts, Baloo and Montserrat, contributes to this by blending round edges for a playful look (Baloo) with straight edges for visual contrast (Montserrat).": "设计灵感来自 Solitaire 轻松、有趣的体验。Baloo 的圆润字形营造活泼感，Montserrat 的直线结构提供视觉对比，共同表达甜美、轻松的气氛。",
    "A carefully chosen color palette enhances the theme of leisure and entertainment. Lava and beau blue serve as main colors, creating a harmonious and inviting atmosphere. Light steel blue and queen pink gradients in the background emphasize a cool afternoon and sparkling water feeling, overall imparting a soft and chill sensation to the poster.": "配色以 Lava 与 Beau Blue 为主，搭配浅钢蓝和粉色渐变，表现凉爽午后与波光粼粼的水面，让海报呈现休闲、舒适的感觉。",
    "Taking the same game, Solitaire, the interactive poster ideation introduces a simplified yet engaging approach. Nine cubes, representing the letters in \"Solitaire,\" use a candy color palette, providing a visually appealing and vibrant display. The interactive journey unfolds with cursor movement triggering dynamic color changes in the cubes. Pressing a cube reveals the corresponding letter (\"S\") with accompanying minion sound effects, mimicking the tactile experience of pressing buttons on a phone dial pad. Additional interaction includes pressing cubes corresponding to the letter \"I,\" unveiling little figures subtly hinting at Solitaire being a card game. The culmination involves pressing all letters or cubes, bringing two little figures together, with remaining information appearing to conclude the interactive poster experience.": "互动海报用九个糖果色方块代表 Solitaire 的字母。鼠标移动时方块变色，点击后显示字母并播放小黄人音效，类似电话拨号键的触感。点击 I 方块会出现小人物，暗示纸牌主题；全部点击后，两个人物相聚，剩余信息出现，完成互动。",
    "The interactive poster ideation serves as a simplified base, allowing for potential expansion with additional elements like animations and dialogues between figures, contributing to a more enriched and engaging visual narrative.": "这个简洁的互动原型可继续加入动画与对白，发展出更丰富的视觉叙事。",
    "Artist, Game Designer": "美术、游戏设计",
    "Board Game": "桌面游戏",
    "Dive into the intriguing realm of \"Ink Mayhem,\" where the clash between the digital and analog worlds takes center stage. As a key contributor, I played a pivotal role in bridging these realms, focusing on the visual design elements that transition the digital concept into an engaging analog gaming experience.": "Ink Mayhem 将数字游戏与实体桌游结合。我负责将数字世界的视觉语言转化为富有吸引力的实体游戏体验。",
    "I take pride in my ability to bring the visual elements to life, seamlessly blending the digital and analog worlds. Whether it's the rule book, logo, or cards, I've worked to create a visually engaging experience. The dynamic energy of the digital concept is skillfully translated into a captivating analog gameplay adventure.": "从规则书、标志到卡牌，我努力将数字概念的动态活力融入实体设计，建立统一且生动的视觉体验。",
    "The overall visual effect of the rule book reflects a harmonious blend of digital dynamism and analog aesthetics. Through careful selection of fonts, color palettes, and layout design, I aimed to evoke the essence of the digital world while maintaining a tangible, printed presence.": "规则书结合数字世界的动感与印刷品的质感，通过配色、字体与版式呼应原作。",
    "I took charge of structuring the rule book, ensuring clarity and coherence in conveying the gameplay mechanics. By breaking down complex concepts into digestible sections, I aimed to provide players with an accessible guide that smoothly navigates them through the rules and strategies of \"Ink Mayhem.\"": "我负责整理规则书结构，将复杂玩法拆解成容易理解的章节，帮助玩家快速掌握规则与策略。",
    "The logo serves as the face of \"Ink Mayhem,\" embodying the essence of the game. My role in designing the logo focused on capturing the energy and chaos of the digital-to-analog transition. The result is a distinctive emblem that resonates with the game's core concept.": "标志是 Ink Mayhem 的视觉代表。我着重表现数字与实体碰撞的活力与混乱，使其与游戏概念紧密结合。",
    "In shaping the cards, I infused a digital flair into the analog format. Each card became a canvas for the clash of colors and strategies, with meticulous attention to detail ensuring that the cards not only complement the gameplay but also serve as visual artifacts of the digital-to-analog journey.": "卡牌设计融合数字风格、色彩与策略。我细致处理每张卡的视觉元素，使它们既服务玩法，也呈现这段数字到实体的转化。",
    "\"Ink Mayhem\" stands as a testament to the successful fusion of digital innovation and analog gaming. My contributions to the visual aspects of the rule book, logo, and cards aimed to enhance the overall gaming experience, ensuring that players are not just participants but immersed explorers in the captivating crossover of worlds.": "Ink Mayhem 展现了数字创意与实体游戏的结合。我通过规则书、标志与卡牌设计完善整体体验，让玩家沉浸于两个世界的交汇。",
    "Tom and Jerry Board Game": "猫和老鼠桌游",
    "Game Designer, Artist": "游戏设计、美术",
    "Tom and Jerry is a long-running American cartoon series revolving around Tom Cat’s attempts to capture Jerry Mouse. Chaos ensues and Tom’s plans are thwarted by Jerry’s wits. Sometimes the mayhem extends to the annoyance of Spike Bulldog or the housemaid Mrs. Two-Shoes, in which either would come to punish Tom. Throughout the years, the series applied its plot formula in a number of settings including the house, medieval France, and even outer space.": "《猫和老鼠》围绕 Tom 追捕 Jerry 的故事展开。Jerry 的机智常让 Tom 的计划失败，也时常惹恼 Spike 或女主人。系列将这种喜剧追逐带到家庭、中世纪法国，乃至太空等不同场景。",
    "The game instills excitement and tension as players emulate Tom's pursuit of Jerry. The pursuit and evasion mechanics capture the chaotic and humorous chases seen in the cartoon.": "追逐与逃脱机制让玩家体验动画中的混乱、幽默与紧张感。",
    "Players engage in strategic decision-making, deciding when to deploy item cards for offense or defense. This adds unpredictability, mirroring the unexpected twists in the cartoon.": "玩家需要决定何时使用道具卡进攻或防守，带来如同动画般出人意料的转折。",
    "The game encourages engaging interactions among players. Item card usage and strategic positioning create a dynamic environment, reflecting the slapstick and interactive nature of the cartoon.": "道具运用与策略站位鼓励玩家互动，呼应动画的闹剧式幽默。",
    "The uncertainty in item card usage introduces surprise, requiring players to adapt. This mirrors the unforeseen predicaments often faced by Tom and Jerry, adding humor and unpredictability.": "道具的不确定性要求玩家随机应变，让对局充满意外与趣味。",
    "Playing as Jerry, Tom, or the additional challenge of Spike instills a desire for victory. The competitive drive, coupled with thematic elements, immerses players in the world of \"Tom and Jerry,\" where wit and strategy lead to victory.": "玩家可以扮演 Jerry、Tom，或挑战 Spike，在竞争中运用智慧与策略争取胜利。",
    "\"Tom and Jerry: The Board Game\" delivers beyond a simple adaptation, providing an interactive experience that encapsulates the humor, chaos, and competitive spirit of the iconic cartoon. The game offers a unique blend of strategy, unpredictability, and player interaction, ensuring an entertaining and emotionally engaging gaming session.": "猫和老鼠桌游将动画的幽默、混乱与竞争转化为互动体验，结合策略、意外与玩家互动，让每一局都充满乐趣。",
    "THE NEXT CHAPTER": "下一篇章",
