    "About — Diana Yee": "关于我 — Diana Yee",
    "Game Designer, Game developer, Story Designer": "游戏设计师、游戏开发者、叙事设计师",
    "Diana dedicated to exploring psychological interactions and understanding unique emotional needs. In my work, I emphasize that the end of a story is not the destination but the beginning of the next journey. Each of my games has its own merits, showcasing diverse styles and offering unique emotional experiences. Through this portfolio, I aim to guide players in exploring profound psychological interactions and experiencing the delicate representation of special emotional needs in the gaming world. I hope you can discover everyone's unique story within my creations.": "我致力于探索心理互动，理解独特的情感需求。在我的作品中，故事的结尾并非终点，而是下一段旅程的起点。每款游戏都有不同风格与情感体验。我希望通过这些作品，邀请玩家探索细腻的心理互动，感受游戏对特殊情感需求的表达，并发现属于每个人的独特故事。",
