    "Developed accessible gaming prototypes for individuals with developmental impairments using Unity and C#.": "使用 Unity 和 C# 为有发展障碍的人群开发无障碍游戏原型。",
    "Translated research goals into concrete system mechanics and implementations.": "将研究目标转化为具体的系统机制与实现。",
